@startuml b3dm_worldorigin_collaboration
title UpdateWorldOrigin 협력 다이어그램 — ECEF → 원점-상대 좌표 변환

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam wrapWidth 240
skinparam rectangle {
    BackgroundColor White
    BorderColor Black
}
skinparam arrowColor Black

rectangle "WorldGlobe\nInitialize()" as WG
rectangle "Coordinates / worldContext\nWorldOrigin 저장" as COORD
rectangle "ViewPort.Camera\nLookAt = 원점-상대(≈0)" as CAM
rectangle "CustomMultiTilesetBehaviour\nUpdateWorldOrigin(WorldOrigin)" as CMB
rectangle "B3dmTileset\nGetRootTransform()" as BTS
rectangle "B3dmTile.UpdateWorldOriginRight\n원점 차감 + computedTransform" as UWO
rectangle "CreateBoundingVolume\nOBB.Transform(computedTransform)" as CBV
rectangle "B3dmTilesetTraversal\nDetermineFrustumSet()" as TRAV
rectangle "IntersectPlanes()\nfrustum 판정" as IP

' ===== 메시지 흐름 =====
WG  -[#1a6a1a]-> COORD : 1: SetOrigin(geodetic)
WG  -[#1a6a1a]-> CAM   : 2: Camera.LookAt = convertCoordinateToVector(원점) ≈ (0,0,0)
CMB -[#1a1a8a]-> CMB   : 3: TilesetComplete → UpdateWorldOrigin()
CMB -[#1a1a8a]-> UWO   : 4: UpdateTile(root) ↻ 재귀
UWO -[#8B0000]-> COORD : 5: GetWorldOrign() / GetWorldInvRotation()
UWO -[#8B0000]-> BTS   : 6: GetRootTransform() = worldRot
UWO -[#1a1a8a]-> CBV   : 7: CreateBoundingVolume(box, computedTransform)
CBV -[#1a1a8a]-> TRAV  : 8: tile.BoundingVolume 생성
TRAV -[#8B0000]-> IP   : 9: IntersectPlanes(카메라 frustum)
CAM -[#3a8a3a,dashed]-> TRAV : 카메라 frame (원점-상대)

note bottom of UWO
  UpdateWorldOriginRight 내부
  ─────────────────────────────
  ① transform = schemaTile.GetTransform()
  ② (root) position = transform.Position + Tileset.Translation
  ③ worldOrigin = invRot · GetWorldOrign()
  ④ pos3d = ToGeocentric(position) − worldOrigin   ← 원점 차감
  ⑤ transform = TRS(pos3d, rot, scale)
  ⑥ parent = GetRootTransform() = worldRot
  ⑦ computedTransform = transform.Matrix × parent.Matrix
  ⑧ OBB(원본 ECEF box).Transform(computedTransform)
  ⇒ 기대: center ≈ (0,0,0)
end note

note bottom of IP
  ⚠ 관측된 불일치 (현재 증상)
  ─────────────────────────────
  • 정상(Unity OBB center): (-27908, -15, 545)  ← 원점-상대
  • 현재(MapPrimeNet center): (2217719, 2304534, 5510878)
  • |center| ≈ 6.37×10^6 = 지구 반지름 = 원본 ECEF 크기
  → 회전만 적용되고 worldOrigin 차감이 결과에 반영 안 됨
    (computedTransform 의 translation 이 OBB center 에
     살아남지 못함 — 합성 순서/translation 손실 의심)
  결과: IntersectPlanes = OUTSIDE → isInclude=false → 순회 중단
        (카메라는 원점-상대, 타일은 절대좌표 → 6,000km 밖)
end note

legend right
  |= 색 |= 의미 |
  |<#1a6a1a> 초록 | 초기화 / 원점 설정 |
  |<#1a1a8a> 파랑 | 변환 호출 (재귀 포함) |
  |<#8B0000> 빨강 | 좌표/행렬 조회·판정 |
endlegend

@enduml
